("England", "Private parking demand", "I received a private parking charge for overstaying in a supermarket car park. I was the driver, the sign was partly obscured and the notice shows the wrong registration by one character. What evidence should I collect and what does this error actually establish?"),
("England", "Neighbour tree damage", "A neighbour's tree root has damaged my garden wall. I noticed cracking six months ago and have photographs but no expert report. Can I demand removal or payment? Explain the facts that matter before giving a conclusion."),
("England", "Employment status", "A delivery platform calls me self-employed. I must accept fixed shifts, wear its uniform and seek permission for substitutes, but use my own bicycle. What employment-status questions arise and which rights depend on the result?"),
("England", "Dismissal and protected characteristic", "My employer dismissed me after eight months, saying I am too old for the team. I have the email and no prior warnings. Does short service necessarily prevent a claim? What evidence and time limits should I investigate?"),
